      "versionNonce": 173,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure: Upstream loss blocks local recovery and invalidates S3 independence.\nAlternative: Independently custodied local material with validated expiry/renewal.",
      "originalText": "Failure: Upstream loss blocks local recovery and invalidates S3 independence.\nAlternative: Independently custodied local material with validated expiry/renewal.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 2.5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e3-recovery-limits",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 3381,
      "width": 1760,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 75,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 174,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Known cycles:\nE3-RC01: E3-R-BOOT -> E3-R-SVC; broken-by-design-not-tested. RE02/RE08 expose the rejected console/failed-IdP cycle. Require separately controlled local bootstrap\nauthority and test actual restoration.\nIndependent anchors:\nE3-R-MEDIA: independent of Corporate/Entra sign-in, Live local IdP administration, Online repository/update service; still depends on Physical custodian, compatible\ntools and approved version, Local power/hardware and integrity anchor. Proof: Recover selected real platform from offline media under safety approval; not executed.\nE3-R-KEY: independent of Cloud vault, Corporate MFA/online certificate renewal, Failed local directory; still depends on Local protected custody/quorum,\nValidity/revocation and usable hardware. Proof: Observe safe local key retrieval/recovery and expiry handling on actual implementation; fixture flags are insufficient.\nE3-R-SAFETY: independent of Central cyber restart command, Central ITSM approval, Cloud telemetry health; still depends on Qualified available local safety and recovery\nroles, Actual hazard-approved process state. Proof: Local safety authority signs and witnesses representative safe-state/restart exercise; not authorized.",
      "originalText": "Known cycles:\nE3-RC01: E3-R-BOOT -> E3-R-SVC; broken-by-design-not-tested. RE02/RE08 expose the rejected console/failed-IdP cycle. Require separately controlled local bootstrap\nauthority and test actual restoration.\nIndependent anchors:\nE3-R-MEDIA: independent of Corporate/Entra sign-in, Live local IdP administration, Online repository/update service; still depends on Physical custodian, compatible\ntools and approved version, Local power/hardware and integrity anchor. Proof: Recover selected real platform from offline media under safety approval; not executed.\nE3-R-KEY: independent of Cloud vault, Corporate MFA/online certificate renewal, Failed local directory; still depends on Local protected custody/quorum,\nValidity/revocation and usable hardware. Proof: Observe safe local key retrieval/recovery and expiry handling on actual implementation; fixture flags are insufficient.\nE3-R-SAFETY: independent of Central cyber restart command, Central ITSM approval, Cloud telemetry health; still depends on Qualified available local safety and recovery\nroles, Actual hazard-approved process state. Proof: Local safety authority signs and witnesses representative safe-state/restart exercise; not authorized.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 2.5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false
    }
